p de moeilijkheid om een samenhangende beschrijving van de natuur te ontwikkelen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#96","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z","note":"De aard van ruimte en tijd9789053334249, Hawking metRogerPenrose, Princeton1996. JohnHawkes is contaminatie in geclusterdeOLauteurs; nietals derde fysicus opnemen. Kosmologisch debat, geenfictie."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1892619W"],"review":"content-review-008.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Roger Penrose","role":"coauthor","source":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL25697271M","isbn13":"9789053334249","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.966Z","note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":7353502,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z","review_batch":"nl-s