44506761","isbn_10":null,"title":"Het bal","language":"dut","publisher":"De Geus","id":987235018,"publish_date":null,"cover_id":null}},{"ref":"d17","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":"@w17","language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":"@w17","language":"nl","bound_author_id":"@a11","text":"De familie Kampf is plotseling rijk geworden. Om toegang te krijgen tot een hogere sociale kring organiseren de ouders een bal. Hun veertienjarige dochter Antoinette verheugt zich op deelname, maar haar moeder verbiedt haar te komen. De afwijzing maakt de spanning tussen moeder en dochter scherp voelbaar. Irène Némirovsky laat zien hoe maatschappelijke ambitie en gekwetste trots binnen één gezin op elkaar botsen. Vanuit Antoinettes positie krijgt de voorbereiding van het feest een heel andere betekenis dan haar ouders verwachten.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p301062919","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p301062919"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#109","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z","note":"Het bal9789044506761 is NemirovskyLeBal1930, kortezelfstandigenovelle. Kampfouders enAntoinette; niet eenbundelmetDavidGolder ofnieuwWorksdooraccentvarianten."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p301062919","https://www.grasset.fr/livre/le-bal-9782246151340/"],"review":"content-amendment-004.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL61319692M","isbn13":"9789044506761","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.966Z","note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did